+## Notes
+
+Eight milestones run back-to-back with no gaps or overlap, starting Monday 2026-08-24 and wrapping Monday 2026-11-02 — about ten calendar weeks. All three company holidays fall inside the plan and extend the calendar footprint without adding schedule days: 2026-08-31 stretches `requirements` over the first holiday, 2026-09-25 pushes the end of `build-core` into the following week, and 2026-10-12 does the same for `build-integrations`. The two build phases are the bulk of the work (21 of 48 business days), and the plan ends with a short launch milestone spanning a weekend.
